  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 387
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 按我派的规矩，外门弟子凡是可以突破筑基，就能够晋升为我派内门弟子，并拜入我派长老门下修习。
